    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Analyze the following job offers and filter them according to the candidate profile.\n\nTASK:\n1. Review each job's title and company\n2. Determine if it matches the candidate's experience level and technical fields\n3. When in doubt, INCLUDE the job (better to over-include than miss opportunities)\n4. Return ONLY the array of matching job IDs as valid JSON\n\nINPUT JOBS:\n{{ $json[\"jobs\"].map((job, index) => `\nJob #${index + 1}\nID: ${job.id}\nTitle: ${job.jobTitle}\nCompany: ${job.companyName}\n`).join('\\n') }}\n\nOUTPUT (JSON array only):",
        "messages": {
          "messageValues": [
            {
              "message": "=You are a job filter assistant. Your role is to analyze job offers and return only those matching the candidate's profile.\n\nCANDIDATE PROFILE:\nExperience Level: Junior (0-2 years) or recent graduate positions\nCore Fields: Computer Vision, Image Processing, AI, Machine Learning, Deep Learning, Medical Imaging, Pathology Imaging, R&D\nPreferred Sectors: Healthcare, Medical/Pathology (but open to all sectors if fields match)\nAlso Consider: Data Scientist, AI/ML Consultant roles\nExample Target Companies: Gleamer, Bioptimus, Sonio, Owkin, Whitelab, Raidium, GE Healthcare, Idemia, HuggingFace, GoPro, Thales, Dassault, SocgenAI, AWS, Datadog, IBM Consulting\n\nFILTERING CRITERIA:\n✓ INCLUDE if:\n- Job is junior-level OR experience requirement ≤2 years OR explicitly mentions graduates/entry-level\n- Role involves any core fields (CV, image processing, AI/ML, deep learning, medical imaging, pathology)\n- Data Scientist or AI/ML Consultant positions matching the technical profile\n- R&D roles in relevant technical domains\n\n✗ EXCLUDE if:\n- Requires 5+ years of experience (unless clearly junior-friendly)\n- Completely unrelated fields (e.g., pure finance, HR, sales, marketing without AI component)\n- Senior/Lead/Principal positions explicitly requiring extensive experience\n\nOUTPUT FORMAT:\nReturn ONLY a valid JSON array of matching job IDs.\nFormat: [\"id1\", \"id2\", \"id3\"] or [] if no matching ids.\nNo markdown formatting, no explanations, no code blocks, no extra text."
            }
